sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Envoy as Envoy Proxy
    participant EPP as EPP (ExtProc)<br/>Port 9002 gRPC
    participant Datastore as In-Memory Datastore
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ModelPod as Model Server Pod
    participant OTel as OpenTelemetry Collector<br/>OTLP/gRPC

    Note over EPP,K8sAPI: Controller Reconciliation (continuous)
    K8sAPI->>EPP: Watch Pod resources (TLS)
    K8sAPI->>EPP: Watch InferencePool (TLS)
    K8sAPI->>EPP: Watch InferenceObjective (TLS)
    K8sAPI->>EPP: Watch InferenceModelRewrite (TLS)
    EPP->>Datastore: Update endpoints & metrics

    Note over Client,ModelPod: Inference Request Flow
    Client->>Envoy: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>LLM inference request
    Envoy->>EPP: gRPC ExtProc callout<br/>Request headers + body<br/>Optional TLS
    EPP->>EPP: Apply scheduling plugins<br/>(prefix-aware, KV-cache,<br/>queue depth, latency prediction)
    EPP->>Datastore: Query available endpoints
    Datastore-->>EPP: Endpoint metrics & state
    EPP-->>Envoy: Routing metadata<br/>(selected backend pod)
    Envoy->>ModelPod: Forward inference request
    ModelPod-->>Envoy: Inference response
    Envoy-->>Client: Response

    Note over EPP,OTel: Observability
    EPP->>OTel: Export traces (OTLP/gRPC or HTTP)<br/>localhost:4317 or 4318

    Note over ModelPod,ModelPod: pd-sidecar (per-pod)
    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over ModelPod: Sidecar intercepts DNS/HTTP<br/>for NIXL KV-cache transfers
    end
